# =============================================================================
#  MPAI-AboutMPAI.orch - About MPAI
#  Workflow Description Language v0.3, AIF V3.0
#
#  An App that has no Module work to do: it shows a video. The video is a Basic
#  AudioVisual Object (OSD-BMO-V1.5) that does not carry its data but designates
#  it by a DataURI; the User Agent, which has the screen and the loudspeakers,
#  plays what the URI designates, and the step ends when the video has played to
#  its end or the person has closed it (or pressed Stop).
#
#  Nothing is said here after the video: the MAS launcher, which runs this App,
#  asks "Do you want to try another App?" whenever an App ends.
#
#  The Module is named because a workflow begins "workflow <name> over <Module>";
#  the Controller is not asked to start it, since nothing is asked of it.
# =============================================================================

workflow MPAI-AboutMPAI over 1MAS-APP-V1.0-I01

on Start:

    # --- the video: "In alcuni minuti potete avere un'idea chiara (ma senza dettagli) della proposta MPAI" ---

    acquire Video (OSD-BMO-V1.5) = { "Header": "OSD-BMO-V1.5", "BasicAudioVisualObjectData": [ { "DataURI": "https://youtu.be/ITG6fff89yM" } ] }

    present Video

on Stop:

